OL,4,BFerguson's Glentoran reign hits early  
OL,5,Bturbulence                             
OL,6,GIf Duncan Ferguson is to be a success  
OL,7,Gat Glentoran, it will be without the   
OL,8,Gbenefit of any new manager bounce.     
OL,10,FThe former Everton striker arrived at  
OL,11,Fthe Oval in October amid plenty of     
OL,12,Ffanfare and sparked hopes that the     
OL,13,Fhigh-profile left-field appointment    
OL,14,Fwould be the one to lead the Glens to  
OL,15,Fa first Irish Premiership title since  
OL,16,F2009.                                  
